e then identifying the relevant MP and HP terms and finally mapping the identified terms to terms in the other ontology. Use of skos mappings terms: exact match: MP term is the same as the HPO term, ignoring that the HP term applies only to humans; broad match: HPO term covers more than the MP term, ignoring the species restriction; narrow match: HPO term is more restricted than the MP term; related match: MP term and HPO term share some similarity but would not have a parent-child relation in a shared ontology.\",\"mapping_set_id\":\"https://w3id.org/sssom/commons/mouse-human/mappings/mp_hp_mgi_all.sssom.tsv\",\"mapping_set_title\":\"All mappings of MP terms to HPO terms generated by MGI\"},\"fields\":{\"author_id\":[\"https://orcid.org/0000-0003-4606-0597\"],\"comment\":\"HPO term has specifics for when this would be called in humans that I interpret as more extreme than how the MP term would be applied\",\"confidence\":0.9,\"mapping_date\":\"2023-11-15\",\"mapping_justification\":\"https://w3id.org/semapv/vocab/ManualMappingCuration\",\"object_id\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/HP_0000252\",\"object_label\":\"Microcephaly\",\"object_source\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/hp\",\"predicate_id\":\"http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#narrowMatch\",\"subject_id\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/MP_0000433\",\"subject_label\":\"microcephaly\",\"subject_source\":\"http://purl.obolibrary.org/obo/mp\"}}","exitCode":0,"signal":null,"stdout":"\"sha256:4f108ee5299c643f12a7a0bee818bc651ac89a957dcf0f1bf0bf1819a53abd82\"\n","stderr":"","processError":null},{"command":["/var/folders/tr/qmsqldfn59591rbflj14mc4r0000gn/T/patamaps-discovery-api-_9iocgp5/patamaps","json","digest"],"input":"{\"content\":\"sha256:4f108ee5299c643f12a7a0bee818bc651ac89a957dcf0f1bf0bf1819a53abd82\",\"occurrence\":0}","exitCode":0,"signal":null,"stdout":"\"sha256:4432e6c43dee221a06861a15af7d2897bbd21245f7b849b218cf4eeec80c666f\"\n","stderr":"","processError":null},{"command":["/var/folders/tr/qmsqldfn59591rbflj14mc4r0000gn/T/patamaps-discovery-api-_9iocgp5/patamaps","json","digest"],"input":"{\"namespace\":\"installed\",\"source\":\"scientific\",\"mappingSet\":\"https://w3id.org/sssom/commons/mouse-human/mappings/mp_hp_mgi_all.sssom.tsv\"}","exitCode":0,"signal":null,"stdout":"\"sha256:ab2b300107d9e166743ee21b8c53fbed43c8339dc7c40434faf83d564bd9ad65\"\n","stderr":"","processError":null},{"command":["/var/folders/tr/qmsqldfn59591rbflj14mc4r0000gn/T/patamaps-discovery-api-_9iocgp5/patamaps","json","digest"],"input":"{\"$schema\":\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/roryscot/metamap/main/schemas/relation-pack-v2.schema.json\",\"schemaVersion\":\"2.0.0\",\"id\":\"urn:metamap:relation-pack:scientific-skos\",\"version\":\"1.0.0\",\"description\":\"Bounded binary SKOS mapping profile: symmetric exact/close/related; transitive exact; broad/narrow inverse; exact disjoint with broad/narrow/related; exact is a subproperty of close. Closed explicit laws preserve unknown uncertainty and lossiness, infer no authority or OWL identity, and omit pragmatic non-SKOS chains. Normative source: https://www.w3.org/TR/skos-reference/#mapping\",\"relations\":[{\"id\":\"scientific:exact-match\",\"sourceKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"targetKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"cardinalities\":[\"one-to-one\"],\"cyclePolicy\":\"allow\",\"transitive\":true,\"symmetric\":true,\"impactDirection\":\"none\",\"disjointWith\":[\"scientific:broad-match\",\"scientific:narrow-match\",\"scientific:related-match\"]},{\"id\":\"scientific:close-match\",\"sourceKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"targetKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"cardinalities\":[\"one-to-one\"],\"cyclePolicy\":\"allow\",\"transitive\":false,\"symmetric\":true,\"impactDirection\":\"none\"},{\"id\":\"scientific:broad-match\",\"sourceKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"targetKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"cardinalities\":[\"one-to-one\"],\"cyclePolicy\":\"allow\",\"transitive\":false,\"symmetric\":false,\"impactDirection\":\"none\",\"inverse\":\"scientific:narrow-match\",\"disjointWith\":[\"scientific:exact-match\"]},{\"id\":\"scientific:narrow-match\",\"sourceKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"targetKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"cardinalities\":[\"one-to-one\"],\"cyclePolicy\":\"allow\",\"transitive\":false,\"symmetric\":false,\"impactDirection\":\"none\",\"inverse\":\"scientific:broad-match\",\"disjointWith\":[\"scientific:exact-match\"]},{\"id\":\"scientific:related-match\",\"sourceKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"targetKinds\":[\"scientific:entity\"],\"cardinalities\":[\"one-to-one\"],\"cyclePolicy\":\"allow\",\"transitive\":false,\"symmetric\":true,\"impactDirection\":\"none\",\"disjointWith\":[\"scientific:exact-match\"]}],\"laws\":[{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:reverse-exact\",\"operation\":\"reverse\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:exact-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:exact-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}},{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:reverse-close\",\"operation\":\"reverse\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:close-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:close-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}},{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:reverse-broad\",\"operation\":\"reverse\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:broad-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:narrow-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}},{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:reverse-narrow\",\"operation\":\"reverse\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:narrow-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:broad-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}},{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:reverse-related\",\"operation\":\"reverse\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:related-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:related-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}},{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:exact-chain\",\"operation\":\"chain\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:exact-match\",\"scientific:exact-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:exact-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}},{\"id\":\"urn:metamap:scientific:law:exact-reverse-close\",\"operation\":\"reverse\",\"operands\":[\"scientific:exact-match\"],\"resultRelation\":\"scientific:close-match\",\"handling\":{\"lossiness\":\"conservative\",\"uncertainty\":\"conservative\",\"authority\":\"none\"}}]}","exitCode":0,"signal":null,"stdout":"\"sha256:a78a78f2eedb41c6768cf7aaf490a0246f23b6b58e27d1ecfdf126c1d496bb06\"\n","stderr":"","processError":null}]}
